OL,5,G1500 Police Interceptors
OL,6,     FA van driver blocks himself into a
OL,7,     Fdead end and repeatedly rams the
OL,8,     Finterceptors' car, while elsewhere
OL,9,     Fa self-confident drink driver gets
OL,10,     Fargumentative.
OL,11,G1600 Police Interceptors
OL,12,     FJim and Lisa direct an
OL,13,     Fintelligence-led strike. Suspects
OL,14,     Fare on the move; it's believed
OL,15,     Fthey're in possession of a handgun
OL,16,     Fand ammunition. The Knife Crime
OL,17,     FTeam target drug hotspots.
