OL,5,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FKevin has a rare condition called
OL,7,     Fsyringomyelia, something he will
OL,8,     Fnot recover from. Osman has been
OL,9,     Fin a car accident, but Ramadan
OL,10,     Fmeans he can't take painkillers.
OL,11,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,12,     FMandy, 64, has bled heavily from
OL,13,     Fher nose for over three hours,
OL,14,     Flosing a pint of blood just in the
OL,15,     Fambulance. And Gillian, 76, is
OL,16,     Fbrought in after a fall, covered
OL,17,     Fin blood.
